## Third-party components

`vendor/llama.cpp` is a git submodule of ggml-org/llama.cpp, MIT licensed,
Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml authors. Its LICENSE travels with it and its
copyright headers are retained.

Ideas were studied from prima.cpp (MIT, arXiv:2504.08791); any ported code
retains its MIT headers and attribution. Cake (evilsocket) is FAIR-licensed and
was read for ideas only — no code from it appears here.
